        17,
        28
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Laguna_Niguel%2C_California"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Completion of Interstate 5 in 1959 opened easy access to Los Angeles, sparking a housing boom in Orange County.",
